  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile (config_002) outperforms singleprofile (config_001) with RNA-only models using avgpool aggregation. This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder from PCA_n2000 to scvi_n200 (a more complex model) improves performance while keeping profile_setting=multiprofile and aggregation=avgpool. This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder choice, which is critical for understanding whether more sophisticated encoders yield gains. It balances exploration (testing a new encoder) with exploitation (building on the multiprofile advantage)."
}

